otengine/godot/pull/112426.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112426.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-29T00:03:46Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2256.\r\n\r\nThis takes a similar approach to #67426, where the Inspector was made to display low-resolution textures cleanly without regressions by displaying with TEXTURE_FILTER_NEAREST_WITH_MIPMAPS.\r\n\r\nUpon receiving a preview/thumbnail Texture2D from the queue, before being set as the icon, the texture gets wrapped in a CanvasTexture, which has its texture filtering set if the resource meets the following criteria:\r\n\r\n- It is a CompressedTexture2D or Image resource.\r\n- It is *not* an SVG.\r\n\r\nUse of CanvasTexture is intended to avoid making any breaking changes to render APIs.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112426/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/